#. The introduction for minimaps.
#: src/components/ModalMinimap/index.jsx:14
msgid "<0>The minimap is a new feature that allows you to quickly jump to search matches in a collection by clicking on an active square.</0><1>In the minimap diagram, each square represents part of this collection. Interactive squares represent parts that contain one or more matches for your search.</1>"
